  "_comment": "IPIP public-domain HEXACO-PI (Gentleness, Patience, Flexibility -- Agreeableness facets, Lee & Ashton, 2004/2006) and NEO-PI-R (Dutifulness -- Conscientiousness facet C3, Costa & McCrae, 1992) facet scales (ipip.ori.org/newHEXACO_PI_key.htm, ipip.ori.org/newNEOKey.htm, fetched 2026-10-19). Selected, as a refinement beyond the literal instrument the spreadsheet (12.gdx.virtology/GoDataX_H7ph_33_Virtudes_Instrumentos_Psicometricos.xlsx) suggests, because each facet is a direct, literal, public-domain match for its virtue -- Gentleness for 'Brandura' (the spreadsheet's own suggestion was the vaguer 'IPIP - Agreeableness/Politeness'), Patience for 'Paciencia' (spreadsheet suggested the vaguer VIA 'Self-Regulation'), Flexibility for 'Flexibilidade' (spreadsheet suggested VIA 'Judgment/Open-Mindedness', a weaker conceptual fit than this literal facet), and Dutifulness for 'Responsabilidade' (matches the spreadsheet's own suggestion, 'IPIP - Conscientiousness/Dutifulness', exactly). Catalog registration only -- no participant data collected or associated with this record.",
